{"id":"4829220d0330e683","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-formula-algebra.md","title":"Formula Algebra","display":"df-formula-algebra — Formula Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-formula-algebra","aliases":["57-df-formula-algebra"],"display":"df-formula-algebra — Formula Algebra","depends_on":["[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-arity]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-formula-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-formula-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-algebra — Formula Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9a59657cbfef22b5\" href=\"?note=9a59657cbfef22b5\" title=\"57-df-function\">57-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a> 的字母表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)\">\\(I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9a59657cbfef22b5\" href=\"?note=9a59657cbfef22b5\" title=\"57-df-function\">57-df-function</a>，只含正元函数符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_i=\\mathrm{arity}(i)\">\\(n_i=\\mathrm{arity}(i)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是候选抽象载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的候选运算族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle\\)</span>；不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 是显式固定的候选支持映射，其定义域包含当前候选载体且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 时采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a> 的映射。该支持映射为本谓词的固定环境参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i^{\\mathfrak F}\">\\(f_i^{\\mathfrak F}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak F_S|\">\\(|\\mathfrak F_S|\\)</span> 使用下式的相应投影接口。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\\)</span> 是本条待定义的二元结构谓词；支持映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 取上述固定环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\;\\exists g\\;[&amp;\n\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=I\\land F\\cap\\mathrm{Var}=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land F\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{FV})\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;(\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(g(i):F^{n_i}\\to F)\\land\\exists p\\in F\\;(\\mathrm{FV}(p)=\\emptyset)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\;\\exists g\\;[&amp;\n\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=I\\land F\\cap\\mathrm{Var}=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land F\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{FV})\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;(\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(g(i):F^{n_i}\\to F)\\land\\exists p\\in F\\;(\\mathrm{FV}(p)=\\emptyset)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\langle F,g\\rangle|\\coloneqq F,\\qquad f_i^{\\mathfrak F}\\coloneqq g(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\langle F,g\\rangle|\\coloneqq F,\\qquad f_i^{\\mathfrak F}\\coloneqq g(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来的抽象公式代数而非改成标准语法代数；补上候选结构与被量化的载体、运算族之间的等式。支持映射需要显式给定，不能将只在具体语法上定义的 FV 无条件用于任意集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-f