lse},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\;\\exists g\\;[&\n\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=I\\land F\\cap\\mathrm{Var}=\\emptyset\\\\\n&{}\\land F\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{FV})\\land\\forall p\\in F\\;(\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(g(i):F^{n_i}\\to F)\\land\\exists p\\in F\\;(\\mathrm{FV}(p)=\\emptyset)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"|\\langle F,g\\rangle|\\coloneqq F,\\qquad f_i^{\\mathfrak F}\\coloneqq g(i).","display":true}],"bytes":1931,"backlinks":[{"id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle$ 是 [[57-df-formula-algebra]] 的固定公式代数；$\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)$ 见 [[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]。"},{"id":"c3641f7a442206b5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 固定，$\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle$，$I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)$，$f_i^{\\mathfrak F}=g(i)$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]。$\\tau=\\mathrm{arity}\\upharpoonright I$，$n_i=\\tau(i)$，见 [[57-df-arity]]；元数映射的输入是符号 $i$，不是解释后的函数 $f_i^{\\mathfrak F}$。$\\sigma:F\\to F$；$\\bar x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_{n_i}\\rangle\\in F^{n_i}$，$\\sigma(\\bar x)=\\langle\\sigma(x_1),\\ldots,\\sigma(x_{n_i})\\rangle$ 为逐分量作用，$F^F$ 为从 $F$ 到 $F$ 的函数集合。"},{"id":"394f2aea09fc7e21","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{FormulaAlgebra}(\\mathfrak F_S,S)$，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,(f_i^{\\mathfrak F})_{i\\in I}\\rangle$，以及该定义的支持映射 $\\mathrm{FV}$、元数 $n_i$，见 [[57-df-formula-algebra]]。$\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$S_{\\mathfrak F}$ 是候选三元函数；$\\mathrm{End}(\\mathfrak F_S)$ 在下式定义，$S_{x,t}$ 是其候选切片图。"},{"id":"7f378a9e1168485b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假定 $\\ma